## The byte-for-byte regression fixture: the floor scene under two point
## lights, no AreaLightSource anywhere. Rendered once at this branch's own
## unedited base and once at its tip; the two renders must match exactly,
## since nothing here draws on any area-light code. Not third-party.
Display "arealight_regression.tif" "file" "rgba"
Format 81 81 1
PixelSamples 1 1
Projection "perspective" "fov" [90]
ScreenWindow -1 1 -1 1
Clipping 0.5 50
Option "pathtracer" "integer samples" [64]
Translate 0 0 5
WorldBegin
LightSource "pointlight" 1 "intensity" [4] "from" [-1.5 -2 2]
LightSource "pointlight" 2 "intensity" [2] "from" [2 -3 5]
Surface "matte" "Kd" [1]
Color [0.5 0.5 0.5]
Opacity [1 1 1]
Polygon "P" [-8 -4 -4  -8 -4 12  8 -4 12  8 -4 -4]
WorldEnd
